# the boundary audit list) that this repository's own audit rules forbid in the
# published tree. Their tracked sources live in the private core spec, under
# tools/agent-sessions/recovery-repo-loaders/, and are copied in by the session
# controller - the same pattern the C:\BinaryPaper root loaders use.
